<title>USA: Foremost sets reserve that cuts 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Foremost sets reserve that cuts 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foremost Corp of America said Wednesday it established a reserve that reduces 1996 net income to $2.39 a share from the $2.65 a share reported on February 4.</p>
<p>The accrual was established following a recent ruling by the Supreme Court of Alabama and as a result of the expected settlement of more than 30 Alabama lawsuits against the company.</p>
</text>
